tead of `Mapped[MyEnum]` for enum column if the enum declaration is in a separate file\r\n\r\n\r\n**Expected behavior**\r\n\r\nShould detect the correct value: `Mapped[MyEnum]`\r\n\r\n**To Reproduce**\r\n\r\n\r\n* myenum.py:\r\n```python\r\nimport enum\r\n\r\nclass MyEnum(enum.Enum):\r\n    FOO = \"foo\"\r\n    BAR = \"bar\"\r\n```\r\n\r\n* models.py:\r\n```python\r\nfrom sqlalchemy import Column\r\nfrom sqlalchemy import Enum\r\nfrom sqlalchemy.ext import declarative\r\nfrom sqlalchemy.orm import Mapped\r\n\r\nimport myenum\r\n\r\nclass ModelBase:\r\n    __abstract__ = True\r\n\r\nBase = declarative.declarative_base(cls=ModelBase)\r\n\r\nclass User(Base):\r\n    __tablename__ = \"user\"\r\n    bar_or_foo: Mapped[myenum.MyEnum] = Column(Enum(myenum.MyEnum), nullable=False)\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n**Error**\r\n\r\n`error: [SQLAlchemy Mypy plugin] Left hand assignment 'bar_or_foo: \"MyEnum\"' not compatible with ORM mapped expression of type \"Mapped[str]\"  [misc]`\r\n\r\n\r\n**Versions.**\r\n - OS: Linux\r\n - Python: 3.9.5\r\n - SQLAlchemy: 1.4.18\r\n - Database: postgres\r\n - DBAPI:\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"sqlalchemy-bot","id":36047385,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDQ3Mzg1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36047385?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url